<title>GREECE: Greek bond yield gap widens to 359 bps vs Bund.</title>
<headline>Greek bond yield gap widens to 359 bps vs Bund.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield pread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 359 basis points today from 357 on Thursday at 0923 GMT.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also widened to 258 basis points from 251 on Thursday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.19%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.60%	359	357 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.47%	372	367 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.61%	258	251 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.32%	287	285 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.26%	293	290 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.13%	206	202 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.40%	279	270 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
